<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n80019" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάτος</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰ]</span> (A), ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>trodden</i> or
				<i>beaten way, path</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κιόντες ἐκ πάτου ἐς σκοπιήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					20.137
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάτον ἀνθρώπων ἀλεείνων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					6.202
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ μὲν γὰρ πάτος ἀνθρώπων ἀπερύκει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					9.119
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅ τις πάτου ἔκτοθεν ἦεν ἀνθρώπων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					3.1201
				</span></i>
			 : metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔξω πάτου ὀνόματα</span>
			<i>out-of-the-way</i> words, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Hist. Conscr.</u>
				44
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>floor</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βαλανείου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PFlor.</u>
					384.27
				</span></i>
			 (pl., V <i><span class="en">
				A.
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>treading</i>, prob. cj. in <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				6.6.10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>dirt, dung</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Al.</u>
				535
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Th.</u>
				933
			</span></i> ; <i>scrapings</i> of oil, etc., <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				12.116
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				283
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πύρινος π</span>. prob.
			wheat-<i>field</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PSI</u>
				8.883.8
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span> : the sense <i>food</i>, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pl.</u>
				1185
			</span></i>, invented to explain <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπόπατος</span>. (Cf. Skt.
			<i>pánthās</i>, Slav.
				<i>pąt[icaron]</i> 'path', Lat. <i>pons</i>
			'causeway' ; 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόντος</span>
			.)</div>
